  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -28,15 +28,15 @@ wsbuglink:18734[].\n \n The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2023-27[]\n-// Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n-// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n+* wssalink:2023-27[]\n+RTPS dissector memory leak.\n+wsbuglink:19322[].\n // cveidlink:2023-xxx[].\n-// Fixed in master: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.0: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-3.6: xxx\n+// Fixed in master: 0de07f8fe4\n+// Fixed in release-4.0: 5fe1d08979\n+// Fixed in release-3.6: 1921740b0b\n // CVSS AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:L\n-// CWE-674\n+// CWE-789\n \n The following bugs have been fixed:\n \n@@ -45,6 +45,18 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark insists on subscribing to two dozen streaming services but only watches three.\n \n+* Updating from within Wireshark if a file is open fails because it can't close Wireshark. wsbuglink:17658[].\n+* ESL timestamp provided by ET2000 not displayed. wsbuglink:18308[].\n+* Kafka: dissect_kafka_sync_group_request missing version check for instance_id. wsbuglink:19290[].\n+* Start Capture via context menu crashes on macOS with an older Qt version. wsbuglink:19299[].\n+* Delta time displayed is incorrect after unsetting time reference. wsbuglink:19324[].\n+* Fuzz job crash output: randpkt-2023-09-09-7060.pcap. wsbuglink:19332[].\n+* Missing one bit in SCCP::sequencing/segmenting. wsbuglink:19336[].\n+* Protobuf field malformed packet for last byte of 'repeated fixed32' wsbuglink:19342[].\n+* RTP/RFC 4571: Wrong desegmentation/reassembly in RTP over TCP packets. wsbuglink:19345[].\n+* Sparklines not working on macOS Sonoma with both native OS and Homebrew pcap. wsbuglink:19349[].\n+* Incorrect bit values and namings in BSS Configuration Report TLV. wsbuglink:19352[].\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n@@ -58,9 +70,22 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n === Updated Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.0.8.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.0.9.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+ESL\n+GNW\n+IDN\n+IEEE 1722\n+IEEE 1905.1a\n+ITS\n+Kafka\n+ProtoBuf\n+RTP\n+RTPS\n+SCCP\n+TACACS\n+Tibia\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
